      <abstract>
        <p>Electrocardiogram (ECG) analysis is crucial for cardiac diagnosis. We present a self-supervised foundation model for ECG.</p>
        <p>Experiments on six public datasets demonstrate state-of-the-art performance across rhythm and morphology classification.</p>
      </abstract>
