        <head>Introduction</head>
        <p>ECG signals are widely used in clinical practice. Previous studies <ref type="bibr" target="#b8">8</ref> and <ref type="bibr" target="#b12">12</ref> showed that contrastive learning works well for physiological signals.</p>
        <p>HeartBEiT <ref type="bibr" target="#b8">8</ref> leverages masked image modeling on heartbeats.</p>
      </div>
